{"articleNo":"238282","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=238282&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] ★★★2020학년도 1학기 긴급재난지원장학금(코로나19) 신청 안내★★★","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.06.18","hit":"10210","attachments":[{"name":"2020-1 긴급재난지원장학금(코로나19) 신청 안내 및 개인정보 수집·이용 동의서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=238282&attachNo=89243"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">2020학년도&nbsp;1학기&nbsp;긴급재난지원장학금(코로나19)&nbsp;신청&nbsp;안내</span></strong><br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n코로나19로&nbsp;인한&nbsp;학부모(본인&nbsp;및&nbsp;배우자&nbsp;포함)의&nbsp;실직․폐업으로&nbsp;경제적&nbsp;어려움을&nbsp;겪고&nbsp;있는&nbsp;학생의&nbsp;부담을&nbsp;완화하고&nbsp;안정적인&nbsp;학업여건을&nbsp;지원하기&nbsp;위하여&nbsp;다음과&nbsp;같이&nbsp;장학금을&nbsp;지원하고자&nbsp;하오니&nbsp;기한&nbsp;내에&nbsp;신청하시기&nbsp;바랍니다.<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n1.&nbsp;<strong>신청자격&nbsp;:&nbsp;2020.&nbsp;1월&nbsp;~&nbsp;5월&nbsp;중&nbsp;학부모(본인&nbsp;및&nbsp;배우자)의&nbsp;실직&nbsp;․&nbsp;폐업(휴업)으로&nbsp;장학금&nbsp;지원이&nbsp;필요한&nbsp;학생(계약학과&nbsp;제외)</strong><br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;정규학기에&nbsp;재학중인&nbsp;자<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;직전학기&nbsp;성적&nbsp;및&nbsp;이수학점&nbsp;기준&nbsp;제한&nbsp;없음<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;실직의&nbsp;경우&nbsp;비자발적&nbsp;실직만&nbsp;해당<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;2020.&nbsp;6월&nbsp;~&nbsp;10월&nbsp;실직·폐업(휴업)한&nbsp;경우는&nbsp;2020-2&nbsp;학기중&nbsp;안내&nbsp;예정<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n2.&nbsp;<strong>지원금액&nbsp;:&nbsp;등록금액의&nbsp;10%(등록금&nbsp;범위&nbsp;내에서만&nbsp;지원가능)</strong>&nbsp;<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;* 2020-1학기&nbsp;등록금전액&nbsp;장학금&nbsp;수혜한&nbsp;학생은&nbsp;제외*</span><br>\n</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>3.&nbsp;신청기간&nbsp;:&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2020.&nbsp;6.&nbsp;22.(월)&nbsp;~&nbsp;7.&nbsp;3.(금)&nbsp;18시까지</span></strong><br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>\n4.&nbsp;제출서류</p><!--StartFragment--><table style=\"border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-overlap: never;\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(229, 229, 229); border-width: 0.28pt 0.28pt 1.98pt medium; border-style: solid solid double none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor; padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 116.2pt; height: 25.14pt;\" colspan=\"2\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 130%; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">구분</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(229, 229, 229); border-width: 0.28pt 0.28pt 1.98pt; border-style: solid solid double; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 161.48pt; height: 25.14pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 130%; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">제출서류</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(229, 229, 229); border-width: 0.28pt medium 1.98pt 0.28pt; border-style: solid none double solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 215.25pt; height: 25.14pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 130%; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴